{"availability":"available","full":"WayneChou-bot/LLM-Wiki-Agent-Workflow-Demo","name":"LLM-Wiki-Agent-Workflow-Demo","description":"Karpathy-inspired LLM Wiki demo: AI agents compile raw sources into a persistent, self-linking Markdown knowledge base. The Agent writes. The Wiki remembers. Live interactive walkthrough + local Streamlit app (Gemini).","category":"Productivity","language":"HTML","stars":18,"forks":0,"created":"2026-05-17T02:55:56Z","updated":"2026-08-13T16:00:34Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://llm-wiki-agent-workflow-demo.vercel.app","topics":["ai-agents","gemini-api","karpathy","knowledge-base","knowledge-graph","llm","llm-wiki","llm-wiki-karpathy","markdown","obsidian","personal-knowledge-management","rag","streamlit"],"demo":"https://llm-wiki-agent-workflow-demo.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T15:47:01.849Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T15:47:01.849Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T15:47:01.849Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T15:47:01.849Z","stars":18,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A Karpathy-inspired LLM Wiki workflow, with a multi-agent twist — available as a local Streamlit app and an interactive static showcase site.","Honesty note. This is not a 1:1 implementation of Karpathy's original LLM Wiki gist. Karpathy's pattern organises pages by topic/entity/concept and has a single wiki maintainer. This demo keeps the same three-layer architecture (raw/ + wiki/ + AGENTS.md schema) and the three operations (Ingest / Query / Lint), but adds a multi-perspective remix: four agent roles each compile the same source into their own viewpoint page. Use it as a teaching aid for the pattern, not a faithful reproduction.","The demo shows how several agent perspectives can compile the same raw sources into a durable markdown wiki:"],"features":["Project Manager Agent","Personal Knowledge Agent"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/WayneChou-bot/LLM-Wi